# Generated previews (track maps, gameplay screenshots) — tooling output,
# regenerated on demand with `make track` / `make screenshots`.
#
# ANCHORED to the root on purpose. Unanchored, this pattern matches a
# directory called `previews` at any depth — including
# pwa/public/previews/, which is not tooling output at all: those are the
# campaign menu's biome banners, and they SHIP with the site.
/previews/

# Recorded runs (`make record`, and the SAVE RUN DATA button) — a drive is
# somebody's own measurement, not repository content.
runs/

